# Impeccable design skill. Committed: .impeccable/config.json (shared detector rules and suppressions),
# .impeccable/surfaces/ (surface briefs), .impeccable/design.json, .impeccable/live/config.json and
# .impeccable/critique/ignore.md. Its runtime folders (critique snapshots, mocks/, review/, questions/)
# ignore themselves. Per-developer and generated state stays local:
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/*.log
.impeccable/*.ndjson
